 "text": "Skip to Main Content\n\ninfo@mazingirasafari.com\n\n+255784278205\n\nAbout Us\nContact\nFAQ's\nYour Trip\nTravel Info\nBlog\nWildlife Photography Safari, Capture Every Moment\nENQUIRE NOW\n\n$3150pp\n\n*prices based on 6 people sharing\n\nBEST TIME TO TRAVEL\n\nYear Round (We will discuss with you for your photography goals)\n\nDURATION\n\n12 Days\n\nLOCATIONS\n\nArusha, Serengeti,\nNgorongoro Crater, Zanzibar\n\nSTARTING POINT\n\nFlight into Kilimanjaro\n\nEmbark on an 8-day Tanzania Wildlife Photography Safari under our \"Capture Every Moment\" series, designed specifically for photography enthusiasts. Journey through the renowned parks of Tarangire, Serengeti, and Ngorongoro, where Africa's iconic wildlife and breathtaking landscapes await your lens. With the guidance of professional photography guides, you'll have the opportunity to capture stunning images of majestic animals in their natural habitats and dramatic panoramas that define this rich region. Our carefully selected park-side accommodations ensure you are perfectly positioned to take advantage of the golden hours of dawn and dusk. Whether you’re a seasoned photographer or a passionate beginner, this safari promises to enhance your portfolio with spectacular shots and unforgettable experiences.\n\nITINERARY\n\nDay 1\nDay 2\nDay 3\nDay 4\nDay 5&6\nDay 7\nDay 8\n​\n\nDay 1: Arrival in Arusha\n\nUpon arrival at the airport, you'll be welcomed by our professional representative and experienced driver-guide, who will escort you to your accommodation in Arusha. This day is for relaxation and preparation before your photography safari begins. If the weather permits, enjoy your first photo opportunities with views of Mount Meru and Mount Kilimanjaro.\n\n \n\nConsider optional activities in Arusha to enhance your experience. Options include canoeing on Lake Duluti, city tours, yoga classes, coffee tours, walking tours, and horseback riding, each providing unique photographic opportunities (additional charges apply). This relaxed day ensures you’re ready to capture the incredible sights ahead.\n\nMeal Plan\n\nBed & Breakfast\n\nAccomodation\n\nMount Meru Hotel \n\nDestination\n\nArusha is known as the safari capital of Tanzania's Northern Safari Circuit.\n\nPackage Price includes:\n\n• English speaking professional guide;\n\n• Meals and accommodation as specified in the itinerary \n\n• Private transportation by FWD vehicle equipped with open roof \n\n• Airport Transfers \n\n• Park Entry Fees, VAT inclusive\n\n• Ngorongoro Crater Fee, VAT inclusive\n\n• Unlimited (pure) drinking water throughout the safari;\n\n• Flying doctor \n\nPrices can vary between seasons\n\n$3150pp  6+ people\n\n$3380pp  4 people\n\n$3999pp  2 people\n\nPackage Price Does not include:\n\n• Airfares and related costs such as personal travel insurance, visas, and vaccinations;\n\n• Cost of any client-requested itinerary modifications while the safari is in progress;\n\n• Any expenses of a personal nature such as extra beverages, laundry, etc.;\n\n• Gratuity for your safari guides\n\n• Activities Balloon Safari, Masai Village\n\nWidget Didn’t Load\nCheck your internet and refresh this page.\nIf that doesn’t work, contact us.\nRefresh this page\nContact us\n\ninfo@mazingirasafari.com\n\nuk.sales@mazingirasafari.com\n\n+255784278205 / +255767278204\n\nAccessibility Statement \n\nMazingira Eco Friendly Safari Adventure\n\nArusha \n\nP.O Box 12544\n\nStay informed, join our newsletter\n\nEnter your email here \nSubscribe\n\nMazingira Safari © 2023 | ",
